  "description": "Ever since high school, Seon-Yul has been plagued by a bizarre jinx that always leaves her trapped with Ro-un, a taciturn but hardworking student she can never seem to escape. Even attending different college departments doesn’t break the strange cycle. But when Seon-Yul discovers Ro-un’s hidden struggle, their unlikely bond begins to deepen. Is their jinx simply bad luck, or is fate trying to bring them together?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
